             ╭ Leave htui? ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
             │ Leaving closes htui. Work it is running stops with it:                  │
             │   ◐ 1 working · ⚠ 0 waiting   Graphics                                  │
             │   ◐ 1 working · ⚠ 1 waiting · 1 queued   Platform                       │
             │   ◐ 1 working · ⚠ 0 waiting   Ops  ◌ stopping…                          │
             │                                                                         │
             │ S stops them gracefully first, waits up to 20 s for their runs to stop, │
             │ then leaves; each resumes later.                                        │
             │                                                                         │
             │  Enter  leave   Esc  stay   S  stop first                               │
             ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
